FORM K-1.
IN THE MATTER OF: unbounded-memory.

OFF THE RECORD: Build a linked stack from nested exhibits. Push ten squares,
OFF THE RECORD: then print them in reverse order.

THE EXHIBIT OF parcel, COMPRISING contents AND remainder.

ARTICLE 1.
    LET IT BE RECORDED THAT pile IS 0.
    LET IT BE RECORDED THAT depth IS 1.

ARTICLE 2.
    LET IT BE RECORDED THAT pile IS AN EXHIBIT OF parcel WHEREIN
        contents IS depth TIMES depth AND remainder IS pile.
    LET IT BE RECORDED THAT depth IS depth PLUS 1.
    SHOULD depth FAIL TO EXCEED 10, REFER TO ARTICLE 2.

ARTICLE 3.
    SHOULD depth FAIL TO EXCEED 1, REFER TO ARTICLE 4.
    PROCLAIM THE contents ENTERED IN pile.
    LET IT BE RECORDED THAT pile IS THE remainder ENTERED IN pile.
    LET IT BE RECORDED THAT depth IS depth LESS 1.
    REFER TO ARTICLE 3.

ARTICLE 4.
    ADJOURN INDEFINITELY.
